        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "4. Union dues and Agency fees collected by the Employer shall be remitted monthly to the Union's Financial Secretary. In the event it is determined an employee is not in the Bargaining Unit or is reclassified to a position outside of the Bargaining Unit, the Employer will automatically discontinue the employee's payroll deductions for Union dues or Agency fees and will notify the Union Office of such action.",
