        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. The Employer shall not be obligated to take any action under the provisions of Section A. or B. of this Article unless and until the Employer is notified in writing by the Union that an employee, designated by name and payroll number, has failed to comply. The Union agrees to indemnify and hold the Employer harmless from any liability or expense incurred by the Employer because of the payment of dues or fees by an employee or the actual or threatened termination of employment of any employee as a result of such designation by the Union.",
