            "block_content": "2. Any employee who, during the period of the Agreement is a Union member, and is thereafter reclassified to a job outside the Bargaining Unit, and subsequently during the term of this Agreement is returned to a job within the Bargaining Unit, shall be subject to the Union Membership provisions of Section A.",
